# A close side look at the monitor's feet (Animal Maker Engine step 2, feet first, stage A): a level walk, a stop, a
# turn round and a walk back; a picture every 2 ticks (10 a second), made into a video by hand with ffmpeg.
lens 50
walker antcolonies:monitor -5.5 -60 0.5 -90 OwnSize:1.0f,HungryIn:99999,SunIn:99999
follow 0 1.0 -4.5 0 8
cmd tick unfreeze
record on 3
wait 20
go 3 -60 0 0.8
repeat 150
shot w{i}
wait 2
end
go -4 -60 0 0.8
repeat 150
shot t{i}
wait 2
end
